{"id":62782,"date":"2026-08-26T10:00:00","date_gmt":"2026-08-26T09:00:00","guid":{"rendered":""},"modified":"2026-10-16T09:04:49","modified_gmt":"2026-10-16T08:04:49","slug":"trail-do-zezere","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-do-zezere\/","title":{"rendered":"Trail do Z\u00eazere 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Trail do Z\u00eazere 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Trail do Z\u00eazere 2026<\/strong> (11\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se nos dias <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">14 e 15 de novembro de 2026<\/strong> (s\u00e1bado e domingo), em <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Ferreira do Z\u00eazere<\/strong>, no distrito de <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Santar\u00e9m<\/strong>. Nascido da paix\u00e3o pelos trilhos ribeirinhos e de montanha que ladeiam a albufeira de Castelo do Bode, este evento cl\u00e1ssico de outono desafia-te a percorrer encostas exigentes e paisagens deslumbrantes sobre o <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Rio Z\u00eazere<\/strong>. Prepara os teus ritmos na nossa <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none;\">Calculadora de Pace<\/a> e descobre mais provas no guia de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail-running\/\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none;\">Trail Running em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Com partidas junto \u00e0 <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">C\u00e2mara Municipal de Ferreira do Z\u00eazere<\/strong> e meta e secretariado no <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Pavilh\u00e3o Municipal<\/strong>, o programa arranca no s\u00e1bado (14 de novembro) com a <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">C\u00e3ominhada de 5 km<\/strong> (158m D+, \u00e0s 15:00) e o <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Trailinho do Z\u00eazere Kids<\/strong> (\u00e0s 15:10). No domingo (15 de novembro) disputam-se as provas rainha pelas freguesias de Ferreira do Z\u00eazere e \u00c1guas Belas: o <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Grande Trail K49<\/strong> (49 km com 2646m D+, partida \u00e0s 07:00), o <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Trail K33<\/strong> (33 km com 1626m D+, \u00e0s 08:30), o <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Pequeno Trail K22<\/strong> (22 km com 910m D+, \u00e0s 08:45), o <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Mini Trail K13<\/strong> (13 km com 388m D+, \u00e0s 09:15) e a <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Caminhada K13<\/strong> (13 km com 388m D+, \u00e0s 09:30), passando por marcos como o <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Lago Azul<\/strong>, a Capela de S\u00e3o Pedro do Castro, a Lagoa das Serras do Concelho e o Lagar Velho, al\u00e9m do especial <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Desafio Z\u00eazere Vertical<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizado pelo <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Clube de Atletismo de Ferreira do Z\u00eazere<\/strong>, com o apoio do Munic\u00edpio de Ferreira do Z\u00eazere, o evento \u00e9 certificado pela <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">ATRP<\/strong> (integrando os Circuitos Nacionais e os Campeonatos\/Circuitos da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Santar\u00e9m) e pontu\u00e1vel para a <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">ITRA<\/strong>. Limitado a 1500 participantes, garante abastecimentos s\u00f3lidos e l\u00edquidos, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica, seguro, pr\u00e9mio finisher, banhos e servi\u00e7o de massagem na meta.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">14 a 15 de Novembro de 2026<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-r